    <title>v0.29.0-beta.2</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The second beta of 0.29.0. On a Nushi from the &lt;code&gt;nushi@beta&lt;/code&gt; cask, click &lt;strong&gt;Update&lt;/strong&gt; on the card.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;To try&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The softer look&lt;/strong&gt;, across the whole app. Before and after pictures are in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/afrase/nushi/pull/21&quot;&gt;#21&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
